{"id": "NC-I4R1-NO-CONTROLGROUP", "category": "i4r1-required", "what": "Pending becomes Proven without querying or binding the unit's ControlGroup", "files": ["crates/nexus-verifier-sandbox/src/scope/pending.rs"], "edits": 1, "test": "execution::tests::i4r1_10_the_exact_binding_of_the_manager_s_unit_to_the_kernel_s_cgroup_proves", "marker": "the scope was proven without binding the manager's unit to the kernel's cgroup", "mapping": null, "test_passes_unmutated": true, "compiled": true, "failed_intended_test": true, "marker_in_assertion": true, "files_restored": true, "exit": 101, "ok": true, "assertion": "assertion `left == right` failed: the scope was proven without binding the manager's unit to the kernel's cgroup\n  left: [Start(\"nexus-verifier-0956382b692ff5a330aff562f30bdd88.scope\", 1214377), Membership(1214377, true), Open(\"/user.slice/user-1000.slice/user@1000.service/app.slice/nexus-verifier-0956382b692ff5a330aff562f30bdd88.scope\"), GetUnit(\"nexus-verifier-0956382b692ff5a330aff562f30bdd88.scope\"), UnitId(\"/unit/nexus-verifier-0956382b692ff5a330aff562f30bdd88.scope\"), RuntimeMax(\"/unit/nexus-verifier-0956382b692ff5a330aff562f30bdd88.scope\"), OomPolicy(\"/unit/nexus-verifier-0956382b692ff5a330aff562f30bdd88.scope\")]\n right: [Start(\"nexus-verifier-0956382b692ff5a330aff562f30bdd88.scope\", 1214377), Membership(1214377, true), Open(\"/user.slice/user-1000.slice/user@1000.service/app.slice/nexus-verifier-0956382b692ff5a330aff562f30bdd88.scope\"), GetUnit(\"nexus-verifier-0956382b692ff5a330aff562f30bdd88.scope\"), UnitId(\"/unit/nexus-verifier-0956382b692ff5a330aff562f30bdd88.scope\"), ControlGroup(\"/unit/nexus-verifier-0956382b692ff5a330aff562f30bdd88.scope\"), RuntimeMax(\"/unit/nexus-verifier-0956382b692ff5a330aff562f30bdd88.scope\"), OomPolicy(\"/unit/nexus-verifier-0956382b692ff5a330aff562f30bdd88.scope\")]"}
{"id": "NC-I4R1-CONTROLGROUP-BASENAME", "category": "i4r1-required", "what": "the manager's ControlGroup and the kernel's path are compared by their last components only", "files": ["crates/nexus-verifier-sandbox/src/scope/pending.rs"], "edits": 1, "test": "execution::tests::i4r1_06_a_cgroup_of_the_unit_s_name_in_another_place_is_never_proven", "marker": "a cgroup of the unit's name that is not the unit's own was proven", "mapping": null, "test_passes_unmutated": true, "compiled": true, "failed_intended_test": true, "marker_in_assertion": true, "files_restored": true, "exit": 101, "ok": true, "assertion": "/other.slice/{unit}: a cgroup of the unit's name that is not the unit's own was proven: Some(Launch(SetupFailed { stage: Protocol, errno: 0 }))"}
{"id": "NC-I4R1-CONTROLGROUP-MISMATCH", "category": "i4r1-required", "what": "a ControlGroup that disagrees with the kernel's path is ignored", "files": ["crates/nexus-verifier-sandbox/src/scope/pending.rs"], "edits": 1, "test": "execution::tests::i4r1_07_a_control_group_that_is_not_exactly_the_kernel_s_is_refused", "marker": "a control group that is not exactly the kernel's was accepted", "mapping": null, "test_passes_unmutated": true, "compiled": true, "failed_intended_test": true, "marker_in_assertion": true, "files_restored": true, "exit": 101, "ok": true, "assertion": "\"/other.slice/{unit}\": a control group that is not exactly the kernel's was accepted: Some(Launch(SetupFailed { stage: Protocol, errno: 0 }))"}
{"id": "NC-I4R1-ID-MISMATCH", "category": "i4r1-required", "what": "a unit Id other than the generated name is ignored", "files": ["crates/nexus-verifier-sandbox/src/scope/pending.rs"], "edits": 1, "test": "execution::tests::i4r1_09_a_unit_id_that_is_not_exactly_the_generated_name_is_refused", "marker": "a unit id that is not the generated name was accepted", "mapping": null, "test_passes_unmutated": true, "compiled": true, "failed_intended_test": true, "marker_in_assertion": true, "files_restored": true, "exit": 101, "ok": true, "assertion": "Is(\"other.scope\"): a unit id that is not the generated name was accepted: Some(Launch(SetupFailed { stage: Protocol, errno: 0 }))"}
{"id": "NC-I4R1-ABSENCE-GETUNIT", "category": "i4r1-required", "what": "GetUnit NoSuchUnit with the helper outside confirms an uncertain start without a candidate (the I4 R1 rule restored)", "files": ["crates/nexus-verifier-sandbox/src/scope/pending.rs"], "edits": 1, "test": "execution::tests::i4r1_11_an_uncertain_start_without_a_candidate_is_not_released_by_no_such_unit", "marker": "an uncertain start without a candidate was released by the manager's absence", "mapping": null, "test_passes_unmutated": true, "compiled": true, "failed_intended_test": true, "marker_in_assertion": true, "files_restored": true, "exit": 101, "ok": true, "assertion": "assertion `left == right` failed: Timeout: an uncertain start without a candidate was released by the manager's absence\n  left: SandboxUnavailable\n right: CleanupFailed"}
{"id": "NC-I4R1-STOP-REPLY-ABSENCE", "category": "i4r1-required", "what": "a delivered StopUnit reply settles an uncertain start without a candidate", "files": ["crates/nexus-verifier-sandbox/src/scope/pending.rs"], "edits": 1, "test": "execution::tests::i4r1_12_an_uncertain_start_without_a_candidate_is_not_released_by_a_stop_reply", "marker": "a StopUnit reply released an uncertain start without a candidate", "mapping": null, "test_passes_unmutated": true, "compiled": true, "failed_intended_test": true, "marker_in_assertion": true, "files_restored": true, "exit": 101, "ok": true, "assertion": "assertion `left == right` failed: a StopUnit reply released an uncertain start without a candidate\n  left: SandboxUnavailable\n right: CleanupFailed"}
{"id": "NC-I4R1-REAP-UNRESOLVED", "category": "i4r1-required", "what": "the helper is reaped while its uncertain operation stays unresolved", "files": ["crates/nexus-verifier-sandbox/src/execution.rs"], "edits": 1, "test": "execution::tests::i4r1_13_an_uncertain_start_without_a_candidate_is_not_released_by_a_timed_out_stop", "marker": "the helper of an unresolved uncertain start was reaped", "mapping": null, "test_passes_unmutated": true, "compiled": true, "failed_intended_test": true, "marker_in_assertion": true, "files_restored": true, "exit": 101, "ok": true, "assertion": "true: the helper of an unresolved uncertain start was reaped"}
